# Combat arenas (arena/arenas.js, arena/commands.js, design/data/arenas.toml). Not the trial arenas: those are arenas.rcon.
# `ttl arena expect ...` prints "ttl: expected ..." when a value is wrong, which `server.sh test-all` counts as a failure.
# Both arenas are moved to a test spot in the overworld for the run (`ttl arena testat`, glass floors at y 200 far from
# every build), so the test needs neither the placed Walpurgis Hall (ttl:walpurgis) nor a generated Labyrinth; `ttl arena reset` puts them
# back. Bots cannot hit each other: `ttl arena defeat <victim> <by>` runs the fatal-blow path of the damage hook, and
# `ttl arena wave <arena> clear` removes a wave as if it was beaten. `ttl arena testmode on` lifts min_seconds (a 2-second
# duel would otherwise earn nothing). Discord is muted during test runs (and while a bot is online).
# Expect in the log: "[ttl] arena: TtlBotArnB is out of walpurgis (defeated)", "walpurgis duel settled: a",
# "walpurgis party settled: a", "labyrinth wave 3/3", "[ttl] boss: summoning elemental_colossus ... (asked by arena:labyrinth)",
# "labyrinth challenge settled: partial".
# Not asserted here (verify in game): the loot in the inventories, the teleport back to where each bot joined from, the
# skill pact settled by a Labyrinth duel, the real fatal blow, the real Labyrinth hall and the Colossus guard.
ttlbot spawn TtlBotArnA
ttlbot spawn TtlBotArnB
ttlbot spawn TtlBotArnC
ttlbot spawn TtlBotArnD
ttlbot spawn TtlBotArnE
@sleep 2
ttl arena reset
ttl arena testmode on
ttl boss cooldown clear elemental_colossus
ttl arena clear TtlBotArnA
ttl arena clear TtlBotArnB
ttl arena clear TtlBotArnC
ttl arena clear TtlBotArnD
ttl arena clear TtlBotArnE
kubejs stages add TtlBotArnA ttl.life2
kubejs stages add TtlBotArnB ttl.life2
kubejs stages add TtlBotArnC ttl.life2
kubejs stages add TtlBotArnD ttl.life2
execute in minecraft:overworld run forceload add 20064 20016 20112 20064
execute in minecraft:overworld run forceload add 20176 19997 20256 20077
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 20075 200 20023 20109 200 20057 minecraft:glass
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 20176 200 19997 20256 200 20077 minecraft:glass
execute in minecraft:overworld run ttl arena testat walpurgis 20000 189 20000
execute in minecraft:overworld run ttl arena testat labyrinth 20200 163 19500
@sleep 2
ttl arena list

# ---- duel in the Walpurgis Hall: A opens, B joins, E (not Life 2) is refused --------------------------------------------
execute as TtlBotArnA run ttl arena join walpurgis duel
execute as TtlBotArnB run ttl arena join walpurgis
execute as TtlBotArnE run ttl arena join walpurgis
ttl arena expect arena walpurgis state lobby
ttl arena expect arena walpurgis mode duel
ttl arena expect arena walpurgis players 2
ttl arena expect player TtlBotArnA inarena yes
ttl arena expect player TtlBotArnA back yes
ttl arena expect player TtlBotArnE back no
execute as TtlBotArnA run ttl arena start
@sleep 7
ttl arena expect arena walpurgis state fight
ttl arena defeat TtlBotArnB TtlBotArnA
@sleep 2
ttl arena expect arena walpurgis result a
ttl arena expect player TtlBotArnA wins 1
ttl arena expect player TtlBotArnA streak 1
ttl arena expect player TtlBotArnB losses 1
ttl arena expect player TtlBotArnA cooldown walpurgis duel yes
ttl arena expect player TtlBotArnB cooldown walpurgis duel yes
ttl arena expect player TtlBotArnB inarena no
@sleep 6
ttl arena expect arena walpurgis state free
ttl arena expect player TtlBotArnA inarena no
ttl arena expect player TtlBotArnA back no

# ---- a lobby left again closes --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
execute as TtlBotArnC run ttl arena join walpurgis duel
ttl arena expect arena walpurgis players 1
execute as TtlBotArnC run ttl arena leave
ttl arena expect arena walpurgis state free
ttl arena expect player TtlBotArnC back no

# ---- party battle in the Walpurgis Hall: A + B against C + D --------------------------------------------------------
execute as TtlBotArnA run ttl arena join walpurgis party a
execute as TtlBotArnB run ttl arena join walpurgis party a
execute as TtlBotArnC run ttl arena join walpurgis party b
execute as TtlBotArnD run ttl arena join walpurgis party b
ttl arena expect arena walpurgis mode party
ttl arena expect arena walpurgis players 4
execute as TtlBotArnA run ttl arena start
@sleep 7
ttl arena expect arena walpurgis state fight
ttl arena defeat TtlBotArnC TtlBotArnA
@sleep 2
ttl arena expect arena walpurgis state fight
ttl arena defeat TtlBotArnD TtlBotArnB
@sleep 2
ttl arena expect arena walpurgis result a
ttl arena expect player TtlBotArnA wins 2
ttl arena expect player TtlBotArnA streak 1
ttl arena expect player TtlBotArnB wins 1
ttl arena expect player TtlBotArnC losses 1
ttl arena expect player TtlBotArnD cooldown walpurgis party yes
@sleep 6
ttl arena expect arena walpurgis state free

# ---- challenge in Ramiris's Labyrinth (test spot): three waves, then the Elemental Colossus through the boss framework.
# The boss is aborted, so the challenge ends "partial" (all waves, the boss not felled) once it is gone for 15 s.
execute as TtlBotArnC run ttl arena join labyrinth challenge
ttl arena expect arena labyrinth mode challenge
execute as TtlBotArnC run ttl arena start
@sleep 7
ttl arena expect arena labyrinth state fight
ttl arena expect arena labyrinth phase waves
ttl arena expect arena labyrinth wave 1
ttl arena wave labyrinth clear
@sleep 2
ttl arena expect arena labyrinth wave 2
ttl arena wave labyrinth clear
@sleep 2
ttl arena expect arena labyrinth wave 3
ttl arena wave labyrinth clear
@sleep 4
ttl arena expect arena labyrinth phase boss
ttl boss abort elemental_colossus
@sleep 18
ttl arena expect arena labyrinth result partial
ttl arena expect player TtlBotArnC clears 0
ttl arena expect player TtlBotArnC cooldown labyrinth challenge yes
@sleep 6
ttl arena expect arena labyrinth state free

# ---- clean up --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ttl arena reset
ttl boss cooldown clear elemental_colossus
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 20075 200 20023 20109 200 20057 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 20176 200 19997 20256 200 20077 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld run forceload remove 20064 20016 20112 20064
execute in minecraft:overworld run forceload remove 20176 19997 20256 20077
ttl arena clear TtlBotArnA
ttl arena clear TtlBotArnB
ttl arena clear TtlBotArnC
ttl arena clear TtlBotArnD
ttl arena clear TtlBotArnE
kubejs stages remove TtlBotArnA ttl.life2
kubejs stages remove TtlBotArnB ttl.life2
kubejs stages remove TtlBotArnC ttl.life2
kubejs stages remove TtlBotArnD ttl.life2
ttlbot remove TtlBotArnA
ttlbot remove TtlBotArnB
ttlbot remove TtlBotArnC
ttlbot remove TtlBotArnD
ttlbot remove TtlBotArnE
